# AI PowerSalon — environment variables
#
# Every name below is REFERENCED IN THE CODE (enumerated from source, not guessed).
# All values here are PLACEHOLDERS. No real credential is committed to this repository.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Anything left blank falls back to a safe default or disables the feature —
# nothing here fails open.

